{"id": "49728", "title": "爱的涨停板", "author": "楼采凝", "category": "都市言情", "count": 20, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/49/49728.htm", "intro": "不过就是上门找个工作，纯粹混口饭吃而已，这个自大狂妄的总经理大人，到底是看她哪里不顺眼啊？先是讽刺她的身材像竹竿，然后又嘲笑她长得像个“小朋友”，厚！她不过是瘦了一咪咪，又刚好有张娃娃脸而已，难道她天生就是可爱也不行吗？而这样欺负她不够，为了吓跑她，他竟然还叫她去当清洁杂工，让她跟水桶、马桶做麻吉，哇咧～～偏偏她就是不想让他小人得志，咬著牙她也要跟他拚了，看看他还能拿她怎么办？！", "base": "files/article/html/49/49728", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "7056920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "7056921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "7056922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "7056923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "7056924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "7056925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "7056926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "7056928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "7056929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "7056930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "7056932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "7056933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "7056934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "7056935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "7056936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "7056938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "7056939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "7056940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "7056941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章（完）", "file": "7056942.html", "available": false}]}